ferros changed them: operators toka does not take were removed (garbage
collection, exceptions, stack switching, reference types and table operators
other than call_indirect), wasmtime's runtime environment was replaced by
toka's (environ.rs), and memory accesses take no bounds checks (the Cranelift
fork's ferros masking makes every access safe at emission).
